  "bodyHash": "497aa9c2ab78cd6d",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Polytone</span></strong></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/discord.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\" width=\"163\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/patreon.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/social/twitter-plural/cozy.svg\" alt=\"Supplementaries 的 Twitter\" width=\"189\" height=\"55\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/dynamic_badges/blob/master/youtube.svg?raw=true\" alt=\"YouTube 频道\" width=\"183\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Polytone 是一款客户端自定义模组，允许您通过资源包对游戏的各个方面进行广泛调整。<br><br><br>本模组在 <a href=\"https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/polytone/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>维基（WIKI）</strong></a> 上有详尽的文档，其中包括一个示例资源包。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果您有任何问题，请随时联系我。并请记得将 Polytone 添加到您的资源包的可选依赖项中。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">主要功能包括：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义 <strong>客户端粒子效果</strong> <strong>✨</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义 <strong>后处理着色器 🌅</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong>实体模型粒子发射器 🦋</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义 <strong><strong>客户端音效 🎵</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义创造模式标签页 🏷️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>配置界面</strong> 可禁用 <strong>资源包覆盖层 🔧</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">移动 GUI 槽位&nbsp;🗓️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>添加 GUI 元素</strong> 📒</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义物品模型</strong>🗡️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">修改 <strong>现有粒子效果🖌️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>添加/移除 <strong>物品提示文本</strong>&nbsp;🪡</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>更改物品稀有度💍</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义 <strong>地图颜色 </strong><strong>🗺️</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更改 <strong>方块音效 🪅</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义方块 <strong>颜色映射表 🎨</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>自定义 <strong>粒子颜色🍭</strong></strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">方块偏移类型&nbsp;📐</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">随昼夜变化的动画纹理☀️</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>流体颜色映射表 🍸</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义 <strong>生物群系颜色与粒子效果 🌄</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>更改 <strong>刷怪蛋颜色&nbsp;🐣</strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自定义 <strong>天空颜色&nbsp;🌈</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">注册声音事件&nbsp;🔔</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">更改云层高度与天空颜色&nbsp;☁️</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>以及更多功能！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它还向后兼容 Optifine 之前提供的 <strong>color.properties</strong> 系统，使现有资源包中的相关功能也能正常工作。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组旨在尽可能轻量化且运行高效，同时保留最大的自定义能力。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它不仅提供了 color.properties 系统的替代方案，还提供了更多以前无法使用的功能和自定义选项。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">欢迎在您的资源包中使用此横幅，并务必在评论区向我们展示您的作品！</span><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/polytone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/788/551/polytone_banner2.png\" alt=\"polytone_banner\" width=\"250\"></a></p>\n<p>如果您使用的是 Sodium 1.20，请注意部分功能可能无法正常运行。最明显的问题源于 <a href=\"https://github.com/CaffeineMC/sodium-fabric/issues/2298\" rel=\"nofollow\">此 Sodium 的已知问题</a>。</p>\n<p>建议改用 Embeddium。</p>\n<p>此外，您也可以查看此网站 <a href=\"https://github.com/LambdAurora/optifine_alternatives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/LambdAurora/optifine_alternatives</a><br><br>Polytone 活跃支持的版本：</p>\n<p><strong>1.20.1, 1.21.1, 1.21.5, 1.21.11</strong></p>\n<p><strong>为了避免出现错误并获得所有最新功能，请勿使用其他版本。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>📦 知名资源包📦</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffogulous\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/fogulous</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fpolyshader%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/polyshader/gallery</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvisual-effects-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/visual-effects-plus</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-goat-horns%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.planetminecraft.com/texture-pack/unique-goat-horns/</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shrimps-distinct-potions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/shrimps-distinct-potions</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvariant-paintings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/variant-paintings</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4cy5s2UN\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/4cy5s2UN</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-reimagined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-reimagined</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flight-leak%252fversion%252f1.4.0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/light-leak/version/1.4.0</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/golden-days\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/golden-days</a>&nbsp;</strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rainbows-foliage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rainbows-foliage</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fknishles-beautiful-colormap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/knishles-beautiful-colormap</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sunbathing-godrays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sunbathing-godrays</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/iron-oceans-blood-oceans-inspired-by-iron-lung</a></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>想让您的资源包被收录在此吗？请随时联系我。<br><br>此列表并非详尽无遗，仅包含社区提交给我的资源包。<br><br>小贴士：查看上方的“依赖项”部分，可以看到所有已知的资源包。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Polytone 是一款<strong>免费</strong>模组</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">喜欢 <strong>Polytone 资源包</strong> 吗？考虑一下捐赠<br>制作模组花费了我大量时间，如果您喜欢我的工作并希望支持我，可以通过此处进行捐赠。捐赠后，您将获得专属定制的 <strong>地球仪</strong> 和/或 <strong>雕像</strong>！如果您使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 在 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用此优惠。<br><br>也欢迎提出更多功能建议！我很乐意听取您的意见。<br><br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要游戏服务器？不妨看看 Akliz，他们提供专为整合包模组 Minecraft 打造的高品质服务器。</span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">他们的社区氛围非常温馨，技术支持也很棒，服务器体验极佳。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用代码 \"supplementaries\" 可享<strong> 20% 折扣</strong>，同时还能支持到我！</span><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7SXNHTv.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉我们的其他模组🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"幽灵丰收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪灵\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"存储标签\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"奇幻橡树\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯楼梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/490/709/637798404029150212.png\" alt=\"摩艾石像\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/438/886/637685255314420532.png\" alt=\"JEED\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-lily-pads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/551/229/637888507256267100.png\" alt=\"更好的睡莲\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advancement-frames\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/798/638115339656250649.png\" alt=\"进度框架\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/randomium-ore\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/774/800/638115342928765853.png\" alt=\"随机矿\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sleep-tight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/788/418/638141921847312709.png\" alt=\"安睡\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/heartstone\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/555/637793261935851502.gif\" alt=\"心石\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
